<!-- Do (design-smithy §1, §2, §4.4): transitions only. Every form of Smithy posts to -/do/<name> with the session token, which
    the framework checks before a transition runs; each transition calls the one operation of its name through the facade
    (Smithy/SmithyForms.js run, which has each form's fields) and answers 303: to the page of what was made or changed, or
    back to the form's returnTo, a path under this mount, with the refusal's text. previewPost writes nothing: it answers a
    form's text as the authority renders it, to the form's next page or as JSON to the composer's island. Nothing here is
    kept by a cache. heldReport alone is a GET: the page of the link a held report's sender got, which writes nothing. -->
<screen xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
